      "content": "it's not just about my well-being though. it feels deeper than that. like there's no real dignity in it. just constant, messy, loud struggle until someone finally stops breathing. i look at these people and i just feel this heavy emptiness. it's like the whole thing is just a waste of energy. i'm so tired of the fight. i'm just so incredibly tired of everything.",
